abstract: >-
  A leakage-safe benchmark for one-year-ahead district-crop yield forecasting,
  split-conformal intervals and yield-shock alerts on Pakistan Bureau of
  Statistics district crop statistics. Code under MIT; source data are not
  bundled and keep their own licence.
keywords:
